so it's been a few days since I updated  you on this new initiative to expand the  show the gist of the expansion is that  what we would like to do to really  further solidify staffing on the program  and also allow us to continue producing  shows during vacations so that instead  of periods during which there are no new  shows we can kind of have a rotating  staff to continue production I want to  add a new producer position to the David  Pakman show and what we also want to do  is reduce the amount of commercials in  each episode which will give us more  time during our hour sort of broadcast  time clock to do additional political  content and in order to do that the goal  has been to add 500 new paid supporters  of the show be it through membership  patreon or YouTube sponsorship and I am  very pleased to tell you that as of this  morning we passed a hundred and fifty  new supporter marks so the goal is 500  new supporters and we are now beyond 150  new financial supporters and that means  we are inching closer and closer and I  hope that we make this a reality soon  and I do think that that would also  really kind of improve the show's  standing with our affiliate stations  affiliate stations understand that we're  a small operation so that when there are  vacations there are no new shows and  even if they understand it they don't  like it and they often say David it  would be great if you figured out a way  where you could be on vacation and there  could be a guest host and then you could  come back and you could have a fill-in  producer so that everybody can still get  their breaks but you can continue  producing and that's exactly the goal so  there are three ways that you can  participate all three count equally  towards the goal of 500 new financial  supporters number one is membership  membership is the old tried-and-true  method of supporting the show dating  back to 2010 you can go to david  pakman.com slash membership monthly and  yearly memberships are available if you  want a discount off of your membership  you can use the coupon code vote soon 18  that will save you 40 percent you get  all the great member benefits including  the daily bonus show you get the  commercial free audio stream the  commercial free video stream of the show  that's membership very very  straightforward second method that will  will help get us to 500 new supporters  is patreon doesn't matter how much you  have to contribute even if it's $1 a  month which is the minimum on patreon it  still counts as one of those 500 new  supporters you can go to  patreon.com/scishow and hit the orange  become a patron button also great perks  on patreon at the $5 a month level you  get the bonus show and at the $10 a  month level you get not only the bonus  show but also the commercial free video  show every single day and a third option  this is something new and it's perfectly  fine as well it counts just as much  towards 500 new supporters we're part of  a youtube beta for what's called YouTube  sponsorship YouTube sponsorship is $4.99  a month it has its own set of benefits  including a sponsor only icon next to  your name in comment and chat posts as  well as sponsors only posts on YouTube  you just hit the sponsor button on  either the YouTube channel home page or  on any internal video page you can sign  up it doesn't show up a hundred percent  of the time since in beta and YouTube is  sort of testing the algorithm it doesn't  always show it to every visitor to our  channel but it'll eventually be there  and over 150 on the way to 500 and  there's lots of other things I would  also love to do by the way when we get  this new producer there's three to five  new platforms that the program has been  invited to participate in that we just  don't have the capacity right now to  post our content to I'd love to be  putting content on there were sort of  maxed out with current staffing so this  is really this this is a big deal adding  this position will allow us to do about  25 more shows a year it will extend each  show on a daily basis by about 10%  because of the advertisers that we will  pull off of the broadcast show and it  will basically open up the door for new  opportunities new platforms thing that  haven't even told you about because  we don't yet have the staff bandwidth to  do that so let's make it happen  membership patreon YouTube sponsorship  I'll have an update maybe at the end of  the week
 

